flowchart Boarding a Merchant Ship
direction-lr

(Spot Sail) -> <Flag Seen?>
  -navy-> [Run Silent] -> (Slip Away)
  -pirate-> [Share the News] -> (Split a Cask)
  -merchant-> <Surrender?>
    -strikes-> [Board Peacefully] -> (Take the Cargo)
    -fights-> [Grapple and Board] -> (Take the Cargo)
    -flees-> [Chain Shot the Rigging] -> (Take the Cargo)
